<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 27 January <span class="n">8</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/emperor-yuan-of-liang"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/emperor-yuan-of-liang.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Emperor Yuan of Liang</span><span class="tp">508–555</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ludovico-ii-marquis-of-saluzzo"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ludovico-ii-marquis-of-saluzzo.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ludovico II, Marquis of Saluzzo</span><span class="tp">1438–1504</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/francis-drake"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/francis-drake.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Francis Drake</span><span class="tp">c. 1540–1596</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/giuseppe-verdi"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/giuseppe-verdi.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Giuseppe Verdi</span><span class="tp">1813–1901</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/carl-gustaf-emil-mannerheim"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/carl-gustaf-emil-mannerheim.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Carl Gustaf Emil Mannerheim</span><span class="tp">1867–1951</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/jacobo-arbenz"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/jacobo-arbenz.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Jacobo Árbenz</span><span class="tp">1913–1971</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/george-grivas"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/george-grivas.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">George Grivas</span><span class="tp">1897–1974</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/suharto"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/suharto.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Suharto</span><span class="tp">1921–2008</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
